# Nested calc chain

:theorem: {
  :label: thm-calc-nest
  :title: Nesting a calc inside a proof step
}

  A bound that is proved by a short calculation.

::

:proof: {:of: thm-calc-nest}

  :step: A preliminary step so the proof has its own numbered rows around the
  calc. ::

  :step: {:label: stp-calc-host}

    :claim: The calculation below establishes the bound. ::

    :p:

      :calc:

        :step: $f(x) = a - b$

          :p: Because the first reason holds. ::

        ::

        :step: $= a - c$

          :p: Because the second reason holds. ::

        ::

        :step: $\le d$

          :p: Because the third reason holds. ::

        ::

      ::

    :: ::

::
